<title>FRANCE: Danone to publish sales figures Thursday.</title>
<headline>Danone to publish sales figures Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group Danone said it would publish its nine-month sales figures this afternoon after the 1500 GMT bourse close and would host a 1615 GMT conference call with analysts.</p>
<p>The company said journalists could not participate in the conference call.</p>
<p>At 1312 GMT, Danone was down 0.53 percent at 746 francs.</p>
</text>
